#ASSERT `the named text is in force on` (`reference: fee item (a)(3) to section 28`) (Date 10 11 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the named text is in force on` (`reference: fee item (a)(3) to section 28`) (Date 1 1 2018) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the named text is in force on` (`reference: fee item (b)(5) to section 30`) (Date 10 11 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the named text is in force on` (`reference: the 1964 regulations' power line to section 10א of the 1959 Law`) (Date 10 11 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the named text is in force on` (`reference: fee item (a)(1) to section 7`) (Date 10 11 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
